{"d":"Le Rivage immobilier met à votre disposition a la location d'un superbe appartement meublé occupant le deuxième étage d’une résidence gardée à Ain Zaghouan Nord.\nCe dernier est composé d'un salon donnant sur une terrasse, d'une cuisine aménagée et équipée attenante à un séchoir, d'une salle d'eau invités, de deux chambres à coucher et d'une salle de bain.\nL'appartement est équipé de la climatisation et du chauffage central et dispose d’une place de parking au sous-sol.","ph":["https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771089_property_xlarge_81921360.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_743255_property_xlarge_81921361.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_743257_property_xlarge_81921362.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_743260_property_xlarge_81921363.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771085_property_xlarge_81921364.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771086_property_xlarge_81921365.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771090_property_xlarge_81921366.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771091_property_xlarge_81921367.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771092_property_xlarge_81921368.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771093_property_xlarge_81921369.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771094_property_xlarge_81921370.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771095_property_xlarge_81921371.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/298/871F/h/thumb_771096_property_xlarge_81921372.avif"]}